{"name":"Tammar","status":"ok","title":"Tammar","pageId":12944,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Tammar</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thesk\" title=\"Thesk\">Thesk</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Northeast_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Northeast Faerûn\">Northeast Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Large town</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3,594</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Tammar (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SW5oYWJpdGFudHNfb2ZfVGFtbWFyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Inhabitants of  Tammar</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Locations in Tammar (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6TG9jYXRpb25zX2luX1RhbW1hcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Locations in  Tammar</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Tammar (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9UYW1tYXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Organizations in  Tammar</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Tammar</b> was a large town in <a href=\"/wiki/Thesk\" title=\"Thesk\">Thesk</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p209_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p209-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>As of <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a>, it had a population of 3,594.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p209_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p209-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>It was razed by the <a href=\"/wiki/Tuigan_Horde\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tuigan Horde\">Tuigan Horde</a> and subsequently besieged by bandits who took heavy tolls from passing caravans. The government of Thesk hired a hundred <a href=\"/wiki/Orc\" title=\"Orc\">orc</a> soldiers to rid the town of the bandits and these orcs were later hailed as heroes in Tammar. The town was since rebuilt.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p209_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p209-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Novels_&_Short_Stories\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Novels &amp; Short Stories</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Games\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Games</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tammar?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tammar?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"block-indent\"><h4><span id=\"Novels_.26_Short_Stories\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Novels_&_Short_Stories\">Novels &amp; Short Stories</span></h4><div class=\"block-indent\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Lady_of_Poison\" title=\"Lady of Poison\">Lady of Poison</a></i></div><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Games\">Video Games</span></h4><div class=\"block-indent\"></div><div class=\"block-indent\"><b><small>Referenced only</small></b><br><small><i><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_III\" title=\"Baldur's Gate III\">Baldur's Gate III</a></i></small></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tammar?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS3e-p209-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p209_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p209_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p209_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skip_Williams\" title=\"Skip Williams\">Skip Williams</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Heinsoo\" title=\"Rob Heinsoo\">Rob Heinsoo</a>&#160;(June 2001). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_3rd_edition\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 209. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\">0-7869-1836-5</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCac